---
layout: base
title: Contact
description: How to reach Mert Biricik for research collaborations, internships and applied cybersecurity work.
priority: 0.7
changefreq: yearly
---

<section class="container-wide pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <p class="meta-label mb-6">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="display-2 mb-8">Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="font-sans text-xl leading-relaxed text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">
        {{ home.contact.description }} Email is the channel I actually check.
      </p>

      <ol class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <li class="clean-card flex items-start gap-5 hover:border-primary-200 group">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-primary-50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-600 text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-primary-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">
            {% include "icons/mail.svg" %}
          </div>
          <div class="pt-1 min-w-0">
            <p class="label mb-1">Email</p>
            <a href="{{ metadata.social.email }}" class="font-sans font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors break-all">mert@biricik.de</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="clean-card flex items-start gap-5 hover:border-primary-200 group">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-primary-50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-600 text-xl shrink-0 group-hover:bg-primary-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300">
            {% include "icons/github.svg" %}
          </div>
          <div class="pt-1 min-w-0">
            <p class="label mb-1">GitHub</p>
            <a href="{{ metadata.social.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-sans font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors break-all">github.com/mertBiricik</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="clean-card hover:border-primary-200">
          <p class="label mb-1">LinkedIn</p>
          <a href="{{ metadata.social.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-sans font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors break-all">linkedin.com/in/mertbiricik</a>
        </li>
        <li class="clean-card hover:border-primary-200">
          <p class="label mb-1">Google Scholar</p>
          <a href="{{ metadata.social.scholar }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-sans font-medium text-slate-900 hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Publications profile</a>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="mt-14">
        <p class="label mb-4">Open to</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex gap-3 font-sans text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-400 block shrink-0 mt-3"></span><span>Research collaborations in cybersecurity: Zero Trust, cloud security, SASE, OSINT.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3 font-sans text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-400 block shrink-0 mt-3"></span><span>Applied machine learning on critical infrastructure or EEG data.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3 font-sans text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-400 block shrink-0 mt-3"></span><span>Internships and part-time roles that fit around the CyberMACS programme.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="clean-card space-y-6">
        <div>
          <p class="label mb-1">Based in</p>
          <p class="font-display font-semibold text-xl text-slate-900">{{ profile.location }}</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-slate-500">{{ home.contact.workingHours }}</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="label mb-1">Until 2028</p>
          <p class="font-sans text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Moving between Istanbul, Berlin and Skopje with the CyberMACS programme.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
